program	conformance/U06_reads_unsafe_field_undeclared.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	function `f` is not declared `unsafe`, but its body names a value of unsafe type (`UnsafePointer<Int>`)
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: function `f` is not declared `unsafe`, but its body names a value of unsafe type (`UnsafePointer<Int>`)"
log	"  --> examples/conformance/U06_reads_unsafe_field_undeclared.saw:10:14"
log	"     |"
log	" 10 |     let q = h.p"
log	"     |              ^"
log	"   hint: write `func f(...) unsafe` — the unsafety belongs in the signature where every caller can see it; if the operation is sound for every input, keep the wrapper unsafe and expose a safe one that checks its arguments"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
